# webserver_echo — simple echo server
# §19 webServer worked example
WebserverEcho is project
WebserverEcho target webServer
WebserverEcho module examples.webserverEcho
WebserverEcho entry main

examples.webserverEcho is module
examples.webserverEcho path examples.webserverEcho
examples.webserverEcho exports main
examples.webserverEcho purpose "Echo webServer example"
examples.webserverEcho invariant "Handles requests"

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main async no
main purpose "WebServer entry point"
main invariant "Server initialized"

main let code immutable ExitCode 0
main return code
